Package: Friedman
Title: Reusable Tools for Exploratory Data Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Zara", "Gonzalez", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "zaragonzalez@usf.edu")
Description: Provides small, reusable functions for summarizing numeric data,
    inspecting dataset completeness, identifying potential outliers using the
    interquartile range method, and visualizing categorical frequencies.
    Developed from an academic R package exercise and expanded as a portfolio project.
License: CC0
Encoding: UTF-8
